                <p class="dateAesteticTitle2">PRESS RELEASE <br>Sep 26, 2026</p>
                <h3>Vilpa Films Announces Winner and Finalists of 2026 Script to Screen Competition.</h3>
                <p class="dateAesteticTitle2">By Vilpa Films</p>

            </div>
            <div class="col s12 m3"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col s12 m2"></div>
